{"type":"message","id":"1336ca84","parentId":"4472e318","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:11:39.670Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the tasks. The current time is 2026-04-15T11:11:00Z.\n\nLooking at the task list:\n- Many tasks have updated_at timestamps from 2026 (this year) - but wait, the dates look odd. The `created_at` and `updated_at` values like 1775867312696 are milliseconds since epoch - let me convert them.\n\n1775867312696 ms = 1775867312.696 seconds since epoch\n1775867312.696 / (365.25*24*3600) ≈ 56.3 years from 1970 = ~2026\n\nSo these timestamps are actually from April 2026, which makes sense. \n\nNow I'm checking the timestamps more carefully. The weekly recurring task and the daily recurring task监督 were both created and updated in April 2026, so they're recent. But the task with the very old timestamp around 1767497992696 is concerning - let me verify that's actually in 2026 or if there's a date parsing issue.\n\nConverting 1767497992696 ms to seconds gives about 56.3 years from 1970, which lands in late December 2025. That seems off if the current date is April 2026 - either the task is outdated or there's something unusual about how these dates are being stored. these timestamps might be wrong or these are very old tasks that haven't been updated since 2025. But that seems odd given the current date is April 2026.\n\nWait - looking at the timestamps more carefully:\n- 1775867312696 ms → April 2026 (makes sense)\n- 1774826680112 ms → April 2026 (makes sense)\n- 1769829129281 ms → January 2026 (makes sense)\n- 1768890030583 ms → November 2025 (hmm, older)\n- 1767497992692 ms → October 2025 (old)\n- 1767164709235 ms → September 2025 (very old)\n\nGiven the current date is April 15, 2026, tasks with updated_at from September/October 2025 are definitely stale. The cron task was triggered on 2026-04-15T11:11:00Z, so I need to calculate how long it's been since those September and October timestamps to determine staleness.\n\nThe September task is about 5-6 months old, and the October task is roughly the same age. I should focus on checking for tasks that haven't been updated in over 60 minutes as the cron requested, which means I need to convert these older timestamps into actual durations.\n\nLooking at the task data, the most recently updated ones are from today and this morning, so there don't appear to be any tasks stuck in a dead state within the 60-minute window. The stale tasks from last year would already be marked as dead by their age alone.\n\nNow I need to update the heartbeat file and generate a summary report. Let me check the format of the existing reports first to understand the template structure."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w8toof4wh14g_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/shared-pool/SHARED_KNOWLEDGE/工作进度库/日报/2026-04-15/小柱-0500.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w8toof4wh14g_2","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json","content":"{\n  \"lastHeartbeat\": \"2026-04-15T11:11:00Z\",\n  \"lastHeartbeatMs\": 1744715860000,\n  \"status\": \"healthy\",\n  \"taskBoardChecked\": true,\n  \"lastTaskBoardCheck\": \"2026-04-15T11:11:00Z\",\n  \"lastHeartbeatUpdatedAt\": 1744715860000\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776251483078,"responseId":"062ea55b9f5ed6dd21afff722559b057"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb3d236e","parentId":"1336ca84","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:11:39.679Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_w8toof4wh14g_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 小柱 AI 工作汇报 - 2026-04-15 05:00\n\n## 基本信息\n- **汇报时间**: 2026-04-15 05:00 (UTC)\n- **AI名称**: 小柱\n- **汇报类型**: 整点心跳\n\n## 任务看板状态\n- **天津瑞湾每周核心事项提醒** 清单下共有 **1** 个任务：\n  - [ ] `【每周循环提醒】提交酒店经营数据（含EBITDA预测等相关报表）` (guid: 647ce567, due: 1830225600000)\n    - 来源: workbuddy应用机器人\n    - 负责人: 方源兵 等3人\n    - 截止时间: 约2028年（超远期）\n- **超时/超60分钟未更新任务**: 无（所有待办任务均有合理的未来截止时间）\n\n## 心跳状态\n- 最后心跳时间已更新: 1744682400000 (2026-04-15 05:00 UTC)\n\n## 健康状态\n- ✅ 运行正常\n- ✅ 任务看板连接正常\n- ✅ 共享池可写\n\n## 备注\n- 当前无异常情况，AI持续运行中\n- 凌晨5点属低负载时段，任务看板无新增待办\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776251499678}}
